{"id":"pozitsiya","lemma":"позиция","pos":"noun","rank":3111,"glosses":["position (usually in the sense \"stance, attitude\")","item (of goods, equipment, a commodity etc.)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/24/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B8%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B8%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"позиции","plural":"позиции"},"examples":[{"text":"Держите позиции!","en":"Hold your positions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/926669","words":[{"g":"to hold","l":"держать"},null]},{"text":"Может, я сдал позиции?","en":"Have I lost my edge?","words":[{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to deliver","l":"сдать"},null]},{"text":"Займите свои позиции.","en":"Take your positions.","words":[{"g":"to borrow","l":"занять"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null]},{"text":"Мы штурмовали неприятельские позиции.","en":"We stormed the enemy positions.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Мне нравится позиция Тома.","en":"I like Tom's attitude.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"to like","l":"нравиться"},null,{"g":"volume","l":"том"}]}]}